<!--
  Per-system override fallback. theme.xml does:
      <include>./_inc/persystem/$system.xml</include>
  ES resolves $system to the focused system's theme folder; if that file is
  missing it falls back to THIS default.xml (see ThemeData::parseInclude). So
  every system EXCEPT the ones with a dedicated file loads this no-op include,
  which keeps the shared views untouched. Tools gets persystem/tools.xml.
-->
